      "problem": "Expressed as a fraction, ${(\\frac{1}{11})}^{2}=${{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "To work out ${(\\frac{1}{11})}^{2},$ we multiply $\\frac{1}{11}$ by itself:\n\n$$\n{(\\frac{1}{11})}^{2}=\\frac{1}{11}\\cdot \\frac{1}{11}=\\frac{1}{121}\n$$",
