      "problem": "Expressed as a fraction, ${(\\frac{3}{5})}^{2}=${{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "To work out ${(\\frac{3}{5})}^{2},$ we multiply $\\frac{3}{5}$ by itself:\n\n$$\n{(\\frac{3}{5})}^{2}=\\frac{3}{5}\\cdot \\frac{3}{5}=\\frac{9}{25}\n$$",
