      "problem": "Expressed as an improper fraction or mixed number, ${(-\\frac{9}{7})}^{2}=${{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "To work out ${(-\\frac{9}{7})}^{2},$ we multiply $-\\frac{9}{7}$ by itself:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(-\\frac{9}{7})}^{2} & = \\\\ (-\\frac{9}{7})\\cdot (-\\frac{9}{7}) & = \\\\ \\frac{9\\cdot 9}{7\\cdot 7} & = \\\\ \\frac{81}{49} & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
