      "name": "Question 15",
      "problem": "Expressed as a fraction, ${(-\\frac{3}{4})}^{2}=${{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "To work out ${(-\\frac{3}{4})}^{2},$ we multiply $-\\frac{3}{4}$ by itself:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(-\\frac{3}{4})}^{2} & =(-\\frac{3}{4})\\cdot (-\\frac{3}{4}) \\\\  & =\\frac{3\\cdot 3}{4\\cdot 4} \\\\  & =\\frac{9}{16}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
